"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"In 2024, a five-year-old spent hours on the phone with paramedics before her body was found days later in Gaza City.\",            \"english_title\": \"Child Found in Gaza\",            \"translated_version\": \"En 2024, una ni\u00f1a de cinco a\u00f1os pas\u00f3 horas al tel\u00e9fono con param\u00e9dicos antes de que encontraran su cuerpo d\u00edas despu\u00e9s en la Ciudad de Gaza.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Ni\u00f1a encontrada en Gaza\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Martial law has been in place in Ukraine since February 2022, which means elections are on hold.\",            \"english_title\": \"Martial Law in Ukraine\",            \"translated_version\": \"La ley marcial est\u00e1 en Ucrania desde febrero de 2022, lo que significa que las elecciones est\u00e1n en pausa.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Ley marcial en Ucrania\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Skeletal remains found in Lake Mead include what looks like a human jaw with teeth, according to a witness.\",            \"english_title\": \"Remains Found in Lake Mead\",            \"translated_version\": \"Restos \u00f3seos encontrados en el Lago Mead incluyen lo que parece una mand\u00edbula humana con dientes, seg\u00fan un testigo.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Restos en el Lago Mead\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"The US president says they are finalizing documents to avoid import taxes on Canadian goods.\",            \"english_title\": \"US-Canada Trade Talks\",            \"translated_version\": \"El presidente de EE.UU. dice que est\u00e1n terminando documentos para evitar impuestos de importaci\u00f3n en productos canadienses.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Conversaciones comerciales EE.UU.-Canad\u00e1\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Damascus called recent attacks an unjustified act of aggression that threatens regional security.\",            \"english_title\": \"Damascus Condemns Attacks\",            \"translated_version\": \"Damasco llam\u00f3 a los recientes ataques un acto de agresi\u00f3n injustificado que amenaza la seguridad regional.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Damasco condena ataques\"        }    ]}"